  "description": "🎵 <em>This experience is brought to you by Belmont Ensemble. This concert is not affiliated with the Fever Original Candlelight series.</em><br><br> Tickets for <strong>Music from The Movies by Candlelight</strong> at Bloomsbury Central Baptist Church<br> 🎫 Band A (ground floor) ticket for 1<br> 🎫 Band B (balcony) ticket for 1<br> 🎫 Concession (children, full-time students, seniors over 65) ticket for 1<br> Concession ticket holders are able to sit anywhere on the ground floor or balconies (except VIP front row seats).<br><br><strong>Highlights</strong><br>🕯️ Movie music concerts gently lit by candlelight<br>🎻 London's finest musicians<br>🏛️ The beautiful setting of Bloomsbury Central Baptist Church<br>🚩 Seating is unreserved and allocated on arrival - some balcony seats have a restricted view<br><br><strong>General Info</strong><br> 📅 Date: Various<br> ⌛ Duration: 1 hour<br> 📍 Location: Bloomsbury Central Baptist Church<br> 👤 Age requirement: all ages are welcome; however, the concert is not recommended for babies that need to be held in arms<br> ♿ Accessibility: this venue is wheelchair accessible through the main entrance only<br><br><strong>Programmes to include music from the follows Movies : </strong><br><ul><li>Silence of The Lambs (Bach - Goldberg Variations - Aria)</li><li>Immortal Beloved</li><li>Crimson Tide</li><li>Sid and Nancy</li><li>The Pianist (Beethoven - 'Moonlight' Sonata)</li><li>Oceans Eleven (Debussy - Clair de Lune)</li><li>Amadeus (Mozart - 'Abduction from the Seraglio' Overture)</li><li>Green Book</li><li>Collette</li><li>Spiderman (Debussy - Two Arabesque)</li><li>The Truman Show (Mozart - Rondo alla Turca)</li></ul><br>5 September and 14 November<br><ul><li>Handel - Chaconne in G major</li><li>Mozart - Overture<em> 'Die Entführung aus dem Serail'</em></li><li>Mozart - Rondo 'Alla Turca'</li><li>Bach - Jesu, Joy of Man's Desiring</li><li>Bach - Aria from the 'Goldberg Variations'</li><li>Debussy - Clair de Lune</li><li>Beethoven - 'Moonlight' Sonata</li><li><strong>Gunel Mirzayeva - Piano</strong></li></ul><br>3 October<br><ul><li>Beethoven - 'Moonlight' Sonata</li><li>Mozart - Piano Sonata K 330</li><li>Ravel - Pavane pour une infante défunde</li><li>Ravel - Prelude and Toccata from 'Le tombeau de Couperin'</li><li><strong>Nafis Umerkulova - Piano</strong></li></ul><br><strong>Description</strong><br>Experience the magic of cinema through music this Autumn with Music from The Movies by Candlelight! Join the talented pianist Gunel Mirzayeva for a captivating evening featuring a selection of iconic film scores that will transport you to your favorite movie moments.<br> Enjoy the delightful concert and let the enchanting melodies fill Bloomsbury Central Baptist Church under the warm glow of candlelight. Get your tickets now for Music from The Movies by Candlelight and relive the magic of cinema in a truly unforgettable setting!<br>",
